      short: 'The award-winning party game of clever clues: Just One, a co-operative word game for 3–7 players.',
      body: "Just One is a co-operative party game with a brilliant twist, and it won the Spiel des Jahres for good reason. One player is the guesser; everyone else secretly writes a single-word clue for the mystery word — but any clues that match get cancelled before the guesser sees them. Suddenly the obvious hint is a trap, and the whole table is trying to be clever without accidentally thinking alike. It is warm, quick and genuinely funny, works with almost any group from families to parties, and resets in seconds for another round. Simple enough for anyone and sharp enough to keep bringing out, it is one of the best modern party games in a small box.",
